                    </p>
                    <ol class="list-decimal list-inside space-y-1.5 pl-1">
                        <li><strong>Present Identification:</strong> Bring at least one valid government-issued ID (e.g., PhilSys National ID, Driver's License, Passport, UMID).</li>
                        <li><strong>Narrate the Facts:</strong> State the truthful details of the event (date, time, exact location, persons involved, witnesses, and loss/injury).</li>
                        <li><strong>Entry into e-Blotter:</strong> The duty investigator logs your report into the official PNP Crime Information Reporting and Analysis System (CIRAS / e-Blotter).</li>
                        <li><strong>Receive Blotter Extract:</strong> An official certified Police Blotter Extract is issued for legal, insurance, employment, or barangay filing purposes.</li>
                    </ol>
